{
  "source": "Live capture from Claude Code 2.1.252 (`claude --version` \u2192 2.1.252) on Linux, 2026-09-01, through the documented statusLine command input: the wrapper launched `claude --settings <json>` with `statusLine.command` = `cat >> <file>`, in the disposable trusted project /tmp/lim100/scratch. Volatile fields (cost, rate_limits, prompt_id, prompt_cache, session_name, transcript_path, session_id) are scrubbed; every other key is verbatim.",
