    "This account resolves sonnet, opus, and fable to a 1,000,000 window and haiku to 200,000; no supported route on this account produced a same-family 200k/1M pair, so the same-family case in status-line-cases.json stays synthetic.",
    "A payload is emitted at launch before any model turn (total_input_tokens 0), and re-emitted after `/model` with the new model.id and the same session_id."
